backupplus v0.2.0 (2023-01-17 MIB-Wiki)

Usage: backupplus [OPTION]

Options:
        -app 		dump app.img
        -apps 		dump app.img as file structure
        -rcc 		dump RCC images
        -mmx 		dump MMX images
        -abd 		dump AddressBookDB
        -gndb 		dump GraceNoteDB
        -bb 		dump boardbook
        -RSDB 		dump RadioStationDB
        -fileinfo	dump *.fileinfo files
        -media 		dump Media
        -nav 		dump NavDB
        -system 	dump /mnt/system
        -special 	dump special folders
        --help		show this help

Note: Backup will only work in RCC bash!

